  "scope": "0PN, held mouth, radius 1, intake 0.25, half reference head. Same upstream attachment of the one-eighth-pitch tag. Frozen stage probes are non-invasive copies of the completed tagged experiment. Center order and local order are recorded separately. The force change is on the ordered endpoint held at its recorded slip, moving only the upstream wall anchor.",
